Awaid
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 33 DEAL {LEGIY, PAIC}
NUIQ 3 FACE_ALL
NUIQ 4 FACE_ALL
NUIQ 1 FACE_ALL

PAIC 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
PAIC 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
PAIC 1 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

LEGIY 3 FACE_ALL
LEGIY 4 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE LEGIY LEGIY
DEST Rank K
MOVE_STACK NUIQ NUIQ
SRCSTACK Size >= 0
DRAW
PILE ALL PAIC Size > 0
$win
PILE ALL PAIC Empty
